<DocsLayout title="Conversations — Create & Manage | Echophi Docs" description="Create, list, and manage omnichannel conversations through the Echophi Partner API.">
  <h1>Conversations</h1>
  <p>
    Start outbound calls with <code>POST /conversations</code> using an <code>agent_id</code> and destination{" "}
    <code>phone_number</code>. Poll or list conversations for status; fetch transcript, recording, and extraction
    when the call ends.
  </p>
  <p>
    Lifecycle events are delivered to your webhook URL — see <a href="/docs/event-lifecycle">Event lifecycle</a>.
  </p>
